{
  "about": "Dictation's draft edits, shared by the hub (native/host/src/voice/place.rs generates `want`; VOICE_BLESS=1 rewrites it) and every client: GPUI (screens/voice.rs), iOS (VoiceEdit.swift), Android. A client applies each edit at its mark (replace `del` characters with `ins`, mark += adv, caret = old mark + to; a mark past the end is the end) and must reach `want`. `shift` is how the mark moves when the draft changes under it (typing, or a fix chip's `draft` frame): the common prefix p; a mark at or before p stays, else it moves by the change in length, never below p. Lengths are Unicode scalars.",
